  "description": "High-performance CSV and XLSX exporting library for .NET 8+ built on CsvHelper and SpreadCheetah. Convention-based with fluent ExportRule API, supports async streaming, multi-sheet XLSX (1M+ rows), auto-zip for large files, column formatting, decimal precision, enum handling, and minimal API integration. Zero-config with intelligent defaults.",
